{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 25, :comments ["And from the age of fifty he shall return from the army of the service — of porterage. As written in the preceding sections: from age thirty to age fifty." "And shall serve no more — in the porterage service. Rather — ושרת את אחיו — this refers back to both of them: from age twenty-five to thirty, and from age fifty and up, for both of them are disqualified from porterage service. And what shall they do? ושרת — both this one and that one — את — אחיו, to keep the watch; but the porterage service he shall not perform. The phrase ולא יעבוד עוד governs the latter alone."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:49:54.393238098Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}